    <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
      <name>DecorationInscriptionSelection</name>
      <id>27</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>Not all the goods to ship under the goods issue are picked. Do you want to cancel shipment of unpicked goods in the goods issue and move the goods issue to check, or leave the goods issue for picking?</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>همه کالاهای قابل ارسال تحت صدور کالا برداشت نشده‌اند. آیا می‌خواهید ارسال کالاهای برداشت‌نشده در صدور کالا را لغو کرده و صدور کالا را به بررسی منتقل کنید، یا صدور کالا را برای برداشت باقی بگذارید؟</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Отобраны не все товары, отгружаемые ордером. Отменить отгрузку не отобранных товаров в ордере и перевести ордер к проверке или оставить ордер к отбору?</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Siparişle sevk edilen tüm ürünler seçilmedi. Siparişteki seçilmeyen ürünlerin sevkiyatını iptal edip siparişi incelemeye mi taşıyalım, yoksa siparişi seçili olarak mı tutalım?</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>Not all the goods to ship under the goods issue are picked. Do you want to cancel shipment of unpicked goods in the goods issue and move the goods issue to check, or leave the goods issue for picking?</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>Not all the goods to ship under the goods issue are picked. Do you want to cancel shipment of unpicked goods in the goods issue and move the goods issue to check, or leave the goods issue for picking?</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Not all the goods to ship under the goods issue are picked. Do you want to cancel shipment of unpicked goods in the goods issue and move the goods issue to check, or leave the goods issue for picking?</value>
      </title>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
